@startuml RetrievalService_Sequence
skinparam SequenceMessageFontSize 14
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontSize 16

actor Pipeline
participant "RetrievalService" as RS
participant "Vector DB\n(Qdrant)" as DB
participant "Reranker" as Rerank

Pipeline -> RS: retrieve(query)

RS -> RS: Embed query\n(dense + sparse)

alt paper title mentioned in query
    RS -> DB: Search within that article\n(top_k x 10 = 50 chunks)
else no title mentioned
    RS -> DB: Hybrid search across all articles\n(top_k x 10 = 50 chunks)
end

DB --> RS: ~50 matching chunks

RS -> RS: Merge chunks into\none doc per article
note right: Deduplicated into N unique\narticles (N <= 50, varies\nby chunk distribution)

RS -> Rerank: Rerank N articles
Rerank --> RS: Top 5 ranked articles\n(top_k = 5)

RS --> Pipeline: 5 documents + scores

@enduml